    "bio": "A Representative from Florida; born in Amityville, Suffolk County, N.Y., August 31, 1953; graduated from Farmingdale High School, Farmingdale, N.Y., 1971; B.S., State University of New York, Stony Brook, N.Y., 1978; M.D., State University of New York, Buffalo, N.Y., 1981; United States Army, 1981-1987; United States Army Reserve, 1987-1992; physician, internal medicine; elected as a Republican to the One Hundred Fourth and to the six succeeding Congresses (January 3, 1995-January 3, 2009); was not a candidate for reelection to the One Hundred Eleventh Congress in 2008.",
